GPON Standard: ITU-T G.984.x","c":[]},{"h":"Downstream Speed: Up to 2.488 Gbps per GPON Port","c":[]},{"h":"Upstream Speed: Up to 1.244 Gbps per GPON Port","c":[]},{"h":"ONU Management: OMCI","c":[]},{"h":"Layer Features: VLAN, QoS, ACL, STP/RSTP","c":[]},{"h":"Network Protocol: IPv4 / IPv6","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The KingType GPT-C224V 4-Port GPON OLT is a carrier-grade Optical Line Terminal (OLT) designed to deliver high-speed, stable, and scalable fiber broadband services for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), telecom operators, and enterprise networks. Featuring 4 GPON PON ports, the GPT-C224V provides a cost-effective solution for deploying FTTH (Fiber to the Home), FTTB (Fiber to the Building), and FTTO (Fiber to the Office) networks with outstanding reliability and performance.</p><p><br></p><p>Built on the ITU-T G.984.x GPON standard, this OLT supports high-bandwidth fiber transmission with advanced Layer 2 switching, VLAN, QoS, ACL, IGMP Snooping, DHCP Relay, and OMCI-based ONU management, ensuring seamless broadband, IPTV, and VoIP service delivery. The intelligent management system simplifies ONU provisioning, remote monitoring, and maintenance, reducing operational costs while improving network efficiency.</p><p><br></p><p>The KingType GPT-C224V also supports IPv4/IPv6 networking, SNMP, Web GUI, and CLI management, making it suitable for modern fiber access infrastructures. Its compact 1U rack-mount design allows easy installation in telecom racks and enterprise data centers, providing a scalable and future-ready GPON solution.</p><p><br></p><p>Whether you're expanding an existing GPON network or building a new FTTH infrastructure, the KingType GPT-C224V offers enterprise-class performance, security, and flexibility for next-generation fiber access deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>4 × GPON PON Ports</li><li>Carrier-Grade GPON OLT</li><li>ITU-T G.984.x GPON Standard Compliance</li><li>High-Speed GPON Transmission</li><li>Supports FTTH, FTTB &amp; FTTO Networks</li><li>Advanced Layer 2 Switching</li><li>OMCI-Based ONU Auto Discovery &amp; Remote Management</li><li>VLAN, QoS, ACL &amp; DHCP Relay Support</li><li>IGMP Snooping &amp; Multicast Optimization</li><li>IPv4 &amp; IPv6 Compatibility</li><li>Web GUI, CLI &amp; SNMP Management</li><li>1U Rack-Mount Design</li><li>Stable, Secure &amp; Reliable Network Performance</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600G1-B 8 Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g1-b-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"125,000৳","old":"128,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GS-F Single PON GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gs-f-single-pon-gpon-olt","now":"33,000৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GT 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gt-2-port-gpon-olt","now":"54,000৳","old":"57,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G2-B 16-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g2-b-16-port-gpon-olt","now":"226,000৳","old":"230,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600G0-B 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g0-b-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"87,000৳","old":"89,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM Scalable 8 port with 4 PON port E08GPS-2S+ GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-scalable-8-port-with-4-pon-port-e08gps-2s-gpon-olt","now":"68,000৳","old":"71,300৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G08L 8-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g08l-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HSGQ-G04L 4-Port GPON OLT","href":"/hsgq-g04l-4-port-gpon-olt","now":"71,000৳","old":"73,000৳","single":""},{"name":"ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PON Port GPON OLT","href":"/ecom-e01gp-s-1-pon-port-gpon-olt","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"},{"name":"KingType GPT-C212V 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/kingtype-gpt-c212v-2-port-gp